m-4418080","kind":"announcement","title":"Experimental ENDLESS MODE Deployed","summary":"From Oppressian High CommandTechnical DepartmentApr...October 21st, 2026.ENDLESS STATEMENTTaking into account massive request from our beloved community we have published the experimental ENDLESS MODE in False Echo Demo. It's available in the New Game section:You can choose three separate difficulty rules which are:Timer: race against the time while performing your missionsRotors: adjustment of rotors as per Daily Orders and conditionsStamps: checking whether required stamps are present on input","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T21:06:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030332","verified_at":"2026-10-21T23:04:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4418080-1846651706690858","game_id":"steam-4418080","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: you reported it, we corrected it","summary":"Dear Oppressians,Some 10 days ago False Echo demo went live.We've received hundreds of feedback forms and comments, praising the atmosphere and game story while also noticing certain bugs and points of possible improvements.Being a true STASEC officer your RetroCaptain has analyzed the feedback and took corrective measures to ensure the game is more pleasant and less glitchy. The main points of improvement during this period were:New Features & QoLSteam username now suggested as default player n","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:44:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690858","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4418080-1846018067930514","game_id":"steam-4418080","kind":"announcement","title":"False Echo: The Demo Is Live","summary":"THE DEMO IS LIVEFalse Echo was revealed today as part of the Triple-i Initiative. The demo is available now. March 1942. The Stelantic Ocean. A submarine on a mission.You operate the Obscura machine aboard Submarine 227. Communication intercepts come in. You adjust the machine, decode the messages, and you decide what reaches High Command. The ECHO system marks every message TRUE ECHO or FALSE ECHO, under rules the Oppressian Empire rewrites daily. Truth has many forms, and you get to decide whi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T16:48:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930514","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4418080-1843481262702190","game_id":"steam-4418080","kind":"announcement","title":"False Echo will be at The Triple-i Initiative. Declassification on October 8th","summary":"OPRRESIAN EMPIRE · MINISTRY OF CLARITYIMPERIAL BULLETIN No.5/// TO ALL CITIZENS OF THE EMPIRE \\\\\\\\\\\\Citizens of Oppressia.The Ministry confirms that False Echo will appear at The Triple-i Initiative.On October 8th, a file concerning False Echo will be declassified during the broadcast. Its contents remain restricted until then. Speculation is not permitted.BROADCAST DETAILSDate: October 8thTime: 9am PT / 6pm CESTThe Triple-i Initiative is 45 minutes of back-to-back trailers from independent stud","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-14T16:04:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262702190","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4418080-1842212951300543","game_id":"steam-4418080","kind":"announcement","title":"100,000 Sailors · The New Anthem of Oppressia Cleared for Broadcast","summary":"OPRRESIAN EMPIRE · MINISTRY OF CLARITYIMPERIAL BULLETIN No.4/// TO ALL CITIZENS OF THE EMPIRE \\\\\\\\\\\\Citizens of Oppressia.The Ministry confirms that 100,000 new sailors now serve in the Oppressian Navy.The figure has been verified.Oppressian shipyards and submarine pens continue operating without interruption. The Six-Year Plan remains on schedule.CLEARED FOR BROADCAST: THE ANTHEM OF OPPRESSIABy order of the Ministry of Clarity, the new official Anthem of Oppressia is cleared for broadcast throu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T16:01:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951300543","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4418080-1841579228665994","game_id":"steam-4418080","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #3 Task Status: always know what the mission needs next","summary":"𝐎𝐏𝐏𝐑𝐄𝐒𝐒𝐈𝐀𝐍 𝐍𝐀𝐕𝐘 · 𝐇𝐈𝐆𝐇 𝐂𝐎𝐌𝐌𝐀𝐍𝐃FLEET BULLETIN No.3/// TO ALL RADIO OPERATORS AT SEA \\\\\\\\\\\\Sailors and officers,The Technical Department has been down in the machine spaces again. Turn your volume up: RetroCptn has located his microphone.THE COMPLAINTA station is issued a field manual, a set of daily orders, a folder of instructions and a desk. It is not issued a man to stand behind you and say which of them applies at this particular moment.The result was predictable, and you reported it at lengt","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T15:22:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228665994","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4418080-1840944183779469","game_id":"steam-4418080","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #2 Field Manual: one book for every part and procedure","summary":"𝐎𝐏𝐏𝐑𝐄𝐒𝐒𝐈𝐀𝐍 𝐍𝐀𝐕𝐘 · 𝐇𝐈𝐆𝐇 𝐂𝐎𝐌𝐌𝐀𝐍𝐃FLEET BULLETIN No.2/// TO ALL RADIO OPERATORS AT SEA \\\\\\\\\\\\Sailors and officers,You have been running security ops as you pleased/wished. High Command has decided that is not a system, applicable to Oppressian Navy standards.THE COMPLAINTFor a long time there was no single place holding what an operator actually needs: the core mechanics of the boat, the rules he works under, the settings, the parts.Knowledge of that kind does not survive in a man's head and memory ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-14T12:15:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183779469","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4418080-1840944183776510","game_id":"steam-4418080","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #1 Safe Zones: no more documents lost under the machines","summary":"𝐎𝐏𝐏𝐑𝐄𝐒𝐒𝐈𝐀𝐍 𝐍𝐀𝐕𝐘 · 𝐇𝐈𝐆𝐇 𝐂𝐎𝐌𝐌𝐀𝐍𝐃FLEET BULLETIN No.1/// TO ALL RADIO OPERATORS AT SEA \\\\\\\\\\\\Sailors,High Command has read your reports. For once, it agrees with them.THE COMPLAINTThe Obscura is a rather big piece of hardware. The Teletyper, newly issued, is big as well. A man works at a desk no wider than his own shoulders, and the Navy keeps setting machinery down on it.Operators report that a document put down in the wrong place disappears behind the equipment. The document is not lost (under the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T11:46:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183776510","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4418080":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:30:00Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:30:00Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-441808